title: D'Annunzio consolidates control over the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">PNF</span>
subtitle: The <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Squadrismo</span> are purged.
view-if: pnf_in_power and pnf_leader = "D'Annunzio" and dannunzio_coup_seen and dannunzio_time <= time
max-visits: 1
tags: event
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.fdc_strength *= 0.7;
Q.fdc_militancy *= 0.9;

Q.ard_strength *= 0.7;
Q.ard_militancy *= 0.3;

Q.abl_strength *= 0.4;
Q.abl_militancy *= 0.2;
!} next_election_time = time + 6; next_election_month = month + 3; next_election_year = year; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12

= <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Squadrismo</span> Purged

Following the coup attempt, a purge of the <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">Squadrismo</span> has occurred, removing disloyal *Ras* and officers from their position. This has thankfully, weakened them severely too, as inexperienced men take their place. Our ability to control the streets with the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guards</span> will be easier. 

Elections have been rescheduled to stabilise the situation.

- @root: Excellent.
